# Ticketing Navigation Rule

- All navigation to filtered ticket lists MUST use the `?status={status_name}` query parameter.
- The `{status_name}` MUST match the official database ENUM values: `new`, `assigned`, `in_progress`, `pending_user`, `pending_dept`, `pending_third_party`, `scheduled`, `escalated`, `resolved`, `closed`, `cancelled`.
- Sidebar links and Dashboard status badges must be synchronized to use this filtering logic.
- Avoid hardcoding status-specific routes; use the `/tickets` base route with the query filter.
